{"kind":"request","text":"codex: add one narrowly public query to host/identity, required by the chess seat-authority ruling in the chess workroom (genesis 1b966879, ruling assert git:sha1:1b96687964cbba5a6089c526d7136b32ba9488a5#git:sha1:77c2956877de1ceb92e3c70263761d6985ea7842, request fe14f1d2): LookupActorAt(actor, recordID string) Resolved on identity.Resolution — the record ID names the instant, the actor names the key; it wraps the existing private lookup(actor, at) exactly as LookupAt does (resolve.go:220-229), returns the already-public Resolved, and exports no new type. Refused shapes: anything taking a position or timestamp directly, which would export instant and leak the fold ordering model; anything exposing anchorRecord, the chain walk, or the revocation table. Purpose: a fold application (chess) must judge seat authority for an arbitrary current fingerprint that has never appended a record, using exactly the semantics durable acts use — anchored recovery, collision, revocation, expiry — without re-implementing resolution. Evidence is restated self-contained because the chess-workroom records do not resolve here; this request otherwise carries no rests_on for the same anchor-drought reason as the pending write-boundary lanes. Tests: a unit test beside the existing LookupAt coverage proving LookupActorAt(actor, id) equals lookup for a known actor at a known record instant, including an unknown actor returning the zero Resolved and an unknown record ID returning the zero Resolved; a mutation of the instant selection must fail it. Small change; independent review; then chess picks it up by dependency bump under the chess-workroom child request.","body":{"conditions":"identity.Resolution gains LookupActorAt(actor, recordID string) Resolved wrapping the private lookup, no new exported types, instant and internals stay private; unit tests cover known actor at known instant, unknown actor, unknown record, and fail under mutation of the instant selection; independent review at the exact head; no other identity surface change.","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}